WEBVTT

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.406
They got two times as much money;

00:01:01.509 --> 00:01:04.561
when they passed Go,
they collected twice the salary;

00:01:05.339 --> 00:01:07.620
and they got to roll
both dice instead of one,

00:01:07.644 --> 00:01:09.938
so they got to move
around the board a lot more.

00:01:09.962 --> 00:01:11.568
(Laughter)

00:01:12.018 --> 00:01:13.726
And over the course of 15 minutes,

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:16.241
we watched through
hidden cameras what happened.

00:01:17.257 --> 00:01:19.353
What I want to do today,
for the first time,

00:01:19.377 --> 00:01:21.525
is show you a little bit of what we saw.

00:01:21.549 --> 00:01:23.850
You'll to have to pardon
the sound quality,

00:01:23.874 --> 00:01:25.847
because again, these were hidden cameras.

00:01:25.871 --> 00:01:27.556
So we've provided subtitles.

00:01:27.951 --> 00:01:30.266
[Video] Rich Player: How many
500s did you have?